# Source media and rendered outputs stay out of git (large, regenerable). Text, config, scripts and small stills are tracked.
**/voiceover/*.wav
**/voiceover/*.m4a
**/raw-footage/*
**/screen-recordings/**/*.webm
**/screen-recordings/**/*.mp4
**/music/*.mp3
**/music/*.wav
**/exports/*
**/_work/
!**/.gitkeep
!**/exports/.gitkeep
**/voiceover/_scratch/*.wav
